@startuml
title Reservation event propagation to analytics and billing

participant "reservation-service" as Reservation
database "reservation-postgres" as ReservationDb
queue "RabbitMQ\nsaasplug.events" as RabbitMQ
participant "analytics-service" as Analytics
database "analytics-postgres" as AnalyticsDb
participant "billing-service" as Billing
database "billing-postgres" as BillingDb

Reservation -> ReservationDb : Read pending reservation_event_outbox rows
Reservation -> RabbitMQ : Publish reservation.succeeded or reservation.failed
Reservation -> ReservationDb : Mark outbox row published

RabbitMQ -> Analytics : Deliver to analytics.events
Analytics -> AnalyticsDb : Idempotently insert usage_events by event_id
Analytics -> AnalyticsDb : Refresh aggregate/cache tables on command
Analytics --> RabbitMQ : Ack or reject to DLQ

RabbitMQ -> Billing : Deliver to billing.reservations
Billing -> BillingDb : Idempotently insert billing_events by event_id
Billing -> BillingDb : Apply pricing and create charge when chargeable
Billing -> BillingDb : Stage billing.charge_created outbox event
Billing --> RabbitMQ : Ack or reject to DLQ

Billing -> RabbitMQ : Publish billing.invoice_issued / billing.invoice_paid from outbox
RabbitMQ -> Analytics : Deliver billing projection events
Analytics -> AnalyticsDb : Update billing summary projections

@enduml
